  notes: 'Final-script 17F01 apartment and terminal introduction; ready for a terminal/doorway
    cue binding. Source: HEARTH_Full_Game_Script_Expanded_Native_English_Lobby_Mia_Commentary.md,
    Scene 1.3. Text is synchronized by Tools/Hearth/Dialogue/Sync All Dialogue From
